  "theorem_statement": "The setwise stabilizer of a registered 10-cycle acts faithfully as the full dihedral automorphism group of that cycle and is isomorphic to D10 of order 20. The stabilizer of the intrinsic two-cycle block has order 40 and is the direct product D10 x C2, where the additional central involution exchanges the two registered cycles.",
